* EASYTRIEVE - SUMMARIZE AID PAYMENTS BY DISTRICT
FILE AIDPAY
  DISTID   1  4 A
  AMOUNT   5  9 P 2
FILE AIDSUM
WS-TOTAL W 11 P 2
JOB INPUT AIDPAY
  IF AMOUNT > 0
    WS-TOTAL = WS-TOTAL + AMOUNT
    PERFORM WRITE-SUM
  END-IF
  PRINT AIDRPT
WRITE-SUM. PROC
  PUT AIDSUM
END-PROC
REPORT AIDRPT LINESIZE 132
  SEQUENCE DISTID
  LINE DISTID AMOUNT
